#: ../../tools/cellosaurus_tools.rst:69 4acb5e05e5e34a058582abe4fcd1cb5f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Convert natural language queries to Solr syntax for "
"Cellosaurus API searches. Uses semantic similarity to map terms to "
"appropriate fields."
