#: ../../tools/cellosaurus_tools.rst:103 d642fc679cd64921adea06e217e777f8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Cellosaurus cell lines using the /search/cell-"
"line endpoint. Supports Solr query syntax for precise field-based "
"searches."
msgstr "**描述**：使用 /search/cell-line 端点搜索 Cellosaurus 细胞系。支持 Solr 查询语法以实现基于字段的精确搜索。"

#: ../../tools/cellosaurus_tools.rst:107 6c1476d1f2744624a2bcd3a882e53539
msgid ""
"``q`` (string) (required) Search query. Supports Solr syntax for field-"
"specific searches (e.g., 'id:HeLa', 'ox:9606', 'char:cancer'). See "
"https://api.cellosaurus.org/api-fields for available fields."
msgstr ""
"``q``（字符串）（必填）搜索查询。支持 Solr "
"语法进行字段特定搜索（例如：'id:HeLa'、'ox:9606'、'char:cancer'）。可访问 "
"https://api.cellosaurus.org/api-fields 查看可用字段。"

#: ../../tools/cellosaurus_tools.rst:110 061aba2aeef64a9b83e82e9be67ac42c
#, fuzzy
msgid "``offset`` (integer) (optional) Number of results to skip (for pagination)"
msgstr "``offset``（整数）（必填）跳过的结果数量（用于分页）"

